# Layout ladder, step 9 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): a tank between two supplies and
# two returns -- the storage header sample verbatim. Two source boundaries charge a stratified tank
# at two levels and two consumer boundaries draw from it at two levels; nothing here is a loop.

fluidscript 1
circuit storageHeader
fluid dynamic water
show temperature

S1 inlet t=60 flow=0.12
S2 inlet t=45 flow=0.08
T1 tank volume=300 layers=5 layer[1].t=25 layer[2].t=30 layer[3].t=40 layer[4].t=50 layer[5].t=60 in.level=90% in[2].level=30% out.level=90% out[2].level=30%
RAD_NETWORK outlet flow=0.12
AHU_NETWORK outlet flow=0.08

connections
S1 - T1.in
S2 - T1.in[2]
T1.out - RAD_NETWORK
T1.out[2] - AHU_NETWORK
